  "description": "This C# library includes functions that are missing in .NET: cot, sec, csc, acot, asec, acsc, coth, sech, csch, acoth, asech, and acsch. Also, it includes standard functions: sin, cos, tan, asin, acos, atan, sinh, cosh, tanh, asinh, acosh, and atanh.",
